      "id": "368c8069-2ab4-4a10-b198-568e0c63b729",
      "name": "Public Consultations Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleCalendarTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        3904,
        1584
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Gilded Page & Quill\n### Restoration Consultation Workspace Prep\n\n**Purpose:** Automatically creates a 30-minute \"Restoration Prep\" block before every restoration consultation.\n\n**Flow:**\n1. Watch primary calendar for events\n2. Filter events containing \"Restoration\"\n3. Check for existing prep block (duplicate prevention)\n4. Create 30-min buffer event on the same calendar\n\n**Non-restoration bookings** (e.g., Personal Shopping) are silently skipped.\n\n**Current calendar:** portfolio@example.com\nUpgrade: create a dedicated Staff Operations calendar and update the 3 calendar nodes.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 832,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "e96c0a67-f0b9-4569-a8a3-22d4bdf1a253",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        3536,
        1120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const event = $input.first().json;\nconst title = event.summary || '';\nconst isRestoration = title.toLowerCase().includes('restoration');\n\nreturn [{ json: { ...event, isRestoration } }];"
      },
      "id": "c04658ab-546d-47d5-977f-46a799c833a1",
      "name": "Code: Normalize & Check",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        4352,
        1584
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Event Filter\n\n**Checks:** Does the event title contain \"Restoration\"? (case-insensitive)\n\n**Passes:** Book Restoration - Jane Doe\n**Passes:** Rare Edition Restoration: The Hammond Collection\n**Skips:** Personal Shopping - Lunch\n**Skips:** Appointment - General Inquiry",
        "height": 296,
        "width": 504,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "86044b98-64c9-41b5-995f-09278aed4d36",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        4464,
        1120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 1
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-restore-check",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.isRestoration }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "52ae1b93-362f-48ef-9338-8e17906a63a0",
      "name": "IF: Is Restoration?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        4640,
        1584
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "63bbfdc7-f4a8-445e-b8a0-e4b9d69fde5f",
      "name": "Skip \u2013 Not Restoration",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        4912,
        1760
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const event = $input.first().json;\nconst title = event.summary || '';\n\n// Extract client name from various title formats:\n// \"Book Restoration - Jane Doe\" \u2192 \"Jane Doe\"\n// \"Rare Edition Restoration: The Hammond Collection\" \u2192 \"The Hammond Collection\"\n// Fallback: use full title\nconst match = title.match(/restoration[:\\s\\-\\u2013\\u2014]+(.+)/i);\nconst clientName = match ? match[1].trim() : title.trim();\n\n// Parse consultation start time\nconst rawStart = event.start?.dateTime || event.start?.date || new Date().toISOString();\nconst consultStart = new Date(rawStart);\n\n// Calculate 30-minute prep window immediately preceding consultation\nconst prepStart = new Date(consultStart.getTime() - 30 * 60 * 1000);\nconst prepEnd = new Date(consultStart.getTime());\n\nconst prepTitle = `Restoration Prep: ${clientName}`;\nconst originalDescription = event.description || '';\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    clientName,\n    originalTitle: title,\n    originalDescription,\n    consultationStart: consultStart.toISOString(),\n    prepStartISO: prepStart.toISOString(),\n    prepEndISO: prepEnd.toISOString(),\n    prepTitle,\n    eventId: event.id || '',\n    prepDescription: `Original consultation: ${title}\\n\\n${originalDescription}`.trim()\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "76de2e6e-fcd2-4e43-9478-aa949e023702",
      "name": "Code: Extract Data",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        4912,
        1584
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Duplicate Prevention\n\n**Problem:** If a consultation event is updated (e.g., description change), the workflow re-fires. Without this check, a second prep block would be created.\n\n**Solution:** Search the calendar for an existing event matching the prep title within the exact 30-minute prep window. If found \u2192 skip. If not found \u2192 create.\n\n**Note:** alwaysOutputData is ON so 0 results still continues to the IF check.",
        "height": 316,
        "width": 548,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "e6510544-bb30-4c81-9afd-551293c70d4d",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        5152,
        1104
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "getAll",
        "calendar": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "portfolio@example.com",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": "Portfolio Resource"
        },
        "limit": 10,
        "options": {
          "timeMin": "={{ $json.prepStartISO }}",
          "timeMax": "={{ $json.prepEndISO }}",
          "singleEvents": true,
          "query": "={{ $json.prepTitle }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "17656cc0-5bf2-4f8a-954a-8d4405fcc9cb",
      "name": "Search: Existing Prep Blocks",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleCalendar",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        5200,
        1584
      ],
      "alwaysOutputData": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 1
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-dup-check",
              "leftValue": "={{ $input.all().filter(i => i.json && i.json.id).length }}",
              "rightValue": 0,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "gt"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b7af7cbd-ff3b-4c82-850d-a102057b77d5",
      "name": "IF: Duplicate Exists?",
