    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Prep Block Created\n\n**Title format:** Restoration Prep: [Client Name]\n**Duration:** 30 minutes, ending exactly when consultation begins\n**Color:** Sage Green (Color ID 2)\n**Description:** Includes original consultation title + description so staff know which materials to pull\n\n**Example:**\n- Consultation: \"Book Restoration - Margaret Ashford\" at 2:00 PM\n- Prep block: \"Restoration Prep: Margaret Ashford\" 1:30 PM \u2013 2:00 PM\n\n**Calendar:** portfolio@example.com",
