        "content": "## Status\n\n**Credential:** Google Calendar account (connected)\n**Calendar:** portfolio@example.com (primary)\n\n**Done:**\n- Google Calendar credential connected\n- All 3 calendar nodes use your real account\n- alwaysOutputData prevents empty-result halt\n- Duplicate check uses real event ID filter\n\n**Optional upgrade:**\nCreate a dedicated \"Staff Operations\" calendar in Google Calendar, then update the calendar field in the Search and Create nodes to separate personal from work events.",
